  "text": "<!doctype html><html><head>\n    <title>Where Councils Stand</title>\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Sourced briefings on what councils across the UK have discussed, decided and voted on. Every point cites the council&#x27;s own minutes.\" />\n    <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://wherecouncilsstand.com/\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Where Councils Stand\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_GB\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Where Councils Stand\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Sourced briefings on what councils across the UK have discussed, decided and voted on. Every point cites the council&#x27;s own minutes.\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://wherecouncilsstand.com/\" />\n    <meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n    <script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"WebSite\", \"name\": \"Where Councils Stand\", \"url\": \"https://wherecouncilsstand.com/\", \"inLanguage\": \"en-GB\", \"description\": \"Sourced briefings on what councils across the UK have discussed, decided and voted on, from their own minutes.\", \"publisher\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Where They Stand\", \"url\": \"https://wheretheystand.uk\"}}</script>\n  </head><body><main id=\"main\"><div id=\"app\"><h1>What has your council decided?</h1><p>Ask about anything councils across the UK have discussed, decided or voted on at full council and cabinet. Answers only from the official record, every point linked and checked. <a href=\"/methodology#why\">Why use this rather than a chatbot?</a></p><p>The record holds 2 meetings and 1 named votes from 2 of the 382 councils in the UK, since May 2018. Asking a question needs JavaScript; every council's page, with its named votes, can be read without it, from the <a href=\"/councils\">list of councils</a>.</p><h2>For example</h2><ul><li>What have councils decided about weekly bin collections since 2023?</li><li>How have Reform UK councillors voted on council budgets?</li><li>What have councils said about closing public toilets?</li><li>What have councils in Wales decided about second homes and council tax?</li><li>How did councillors vote on declaring a climate emergency?</li><li>What has Barnsley&#x27;s full council decided about libraries?</li></ul><p><a href=\"/methodology\">How it works</a></p></div></main></body></html>",
  "type": "text/html; charset=utf-8"
 },
